== About me
I am a member of the [http://ddig.csail.mit.edu/ Clinical and Applied ML] group at CSAIL, led by [https://people.csail.mit.edu/guttag/ John Guttag]. I study machine learning, causal inference, and the intersection between the two. My work focuses on building data-efficient causal inference methods in resource-constrained settings, and building robust predictive ML models using ideas from causality.

